{"title":"Hill Giant Adolescent","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 15 Hill Giant that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/giants-knucklebone\">Giants Knucklebone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 3 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 3 looted corpses, 61 recorded drops, 1,770 total, 10–81 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/3</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"leather-legs\" title=\"Leather Legs - in 33% of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/90624d3f11b4f85c3eb3.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Leather Legs</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">33% · 1/3</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"silver-spear\" title=\"Silver Spear - in 33% of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b463ce049563b7e0bed6.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Silver Spear</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">33% · 1/3</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Inferior: 1 of 1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"deerhide-feet\" title=\"Deerhide Feet - in 33% of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/95c89d9d1f55b930cc0a.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Deerhide Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">33% · 1/3</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Windthorne\">Windthorne</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 9 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Colossus%20Ruins\">Colossus Ruins</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 8 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/West%20Tomb\">West Tomb</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 6 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"hill-giant-adolescent\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Hill Giant: <a href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-youth\">Hill Giant Youth</a> <span class=\"muted\">(13)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-titan\">Hill Giant Titan</a> <span class=\"muted\">(18)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-behemoth\">Hill Giant Behemoth</a> <span class=\"muted\">(25)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/9beef5a6d257406a5827.webp\" alt=\"Hill Giant Adolescent\"></div><h3>Hill Giant Adolescent</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>15 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 14–18)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Hill Giant</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>46</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>12.8</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>750</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>5.1 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>23 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}